  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-04-26T10:57:36.575Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "A lot of gaming groups use group posts for announcing that they just opened a new instance for a game night. This means that all these groups have a long post history of \"come join the instance\" and similar.\n\nIt would be useful if we could have temporary group posts, which auto-deletes after a few hours. This could be further improved by having it be an option for members if they want the temporary notifications while they are offline.\n\nThink of it like Discord's @here tag.",
